1
00:03:21,599 --> 00:03:27,599
Small Town Christmas is a drama, romance, tv movie
film directed by Maclain Nelson.

2
00:06:43,199 --> 00:06:49,199
Author Nell Phillips’ first book has become a surprise
best-seller of the Christmas season.

3
00:10:04,799 --> 00:10:10,799
Nell’s last stop on a nationwide book tour takes her to the town of Springdale, the hometown of Emmett Turner, a young
man she met over five years ago while both were junior copy editors at a New York publishing company.

4
00:13:26,399 --> 00:13:32,399
Nell was hurt when Emmett stood her up for a dinner date and then
disappeared from New York without any explanation.

5
00:16:48,000 --> 00:16:54,000
As Nell is quick to admit, Emmett’s colorful, nostalgic anecdotes about Springdale inspired her
to write this book that is shaping her life and especially this holiday season.

6
00:20:09,599 --> 00:20:15,599
Emmett Turner, played by Kristoffer Polaha.

7
00:23:31,200 --> 00:23:37,200
Nell Phillips, played by Ashley Newbrough.

8
